    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom terraced property to the market on Drumfinn Road, Ballyfermot. Presented in immaculate condition throughout, this impressive home offers approximately 88 sq.m. of internal living space and has been thoughtfully upgraded in recent years. With a combination of generous accommodation, quality finishes and excellent additional space to the rear, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers.\nLocated within this mature and well-established Ballyfermot setting, Drumfinn Road is ideally positioned close to a host of local amenities including shops, schools, parks, bus routes and recreational facilities. Ballyfermot village is within easy reach, while excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\nThe accommodation consisting of c. 88sqm of internal floorspace comprises of an entrance hallway, spacious living room and a superb extended kitchen/dining area to the rear featuring a large utility room. The rear kitchen extension benefits from an abundance of natural light, with velux windows incorporated into the roof, creating a bright and welcoming space that is ideal for modern day living and entertaining. Upstairs there are two well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\nOne of the standout features of this property is the fantastic rear garden, which boasts a fully fitted powered unit to the rear of the garden with its own WC, suitable variety of purposes. This versatile additional space offers endless potential and could comfortably cater for a home office, studio, games room, children's playroom or a variety of other uses depending on the buyer's needs. The garden itself provides a lovely private outdoor area with excellent scope for enjoying the sun.\nThe property has also been rewired in recent years, further adding to its appeal, while the overall presentation leaves little for the incoming purchaser to do other than simply move in and enjoy. The property comes to the market vacant with no onward chain, allowing for a straightforward purchase process.\nThis is a superb opportunity for first-time buyers, young families or investors seeking a quality home in a popular and well-connected Dublin location. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the exceptional condition, generous floorspace and fantastic additional accommodation this property has to offer.\nFeatures\n•c. 88 sq.m. internal floorspace\n•2 bed / 2 bath terraced\n•BER C1\n•Immaculate condition throughout\n•Rear kitchen extension\n•Abundance of natural light \n•Powered unit to rear garden\n•Additional WC within rear unit\n•Rewired in recent years\n•Excellent rear garden\n•Vacant with no onward chain\n•Excellent Ballyfermot location\n•Ideal first-time buyer/family home\nDirections \nEircode D10 XP28\n"
      },
      {
